The HL grammar works outside.

Garden beds get addresses. Plant locations get coordinates. Soil amendments, planting dates, harvest records, and seasonal notes are linked to specific positions in the outdoor space.

The Garden App concept extends HL into the yard, the greenhouse, the orchard — anywhere you grow things. The same vault format that tracks your tools tracks your tomatoes.

What grows where, what was planted last year, what the soil pH was in bed 3, what the yield looked like in 2024 — all of it addressable, all of it searchable, all of it connected to the same system that runs your shop.

